Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for mapRequirements. Compare required functions with bid inclusions and exclusions, recognizing different descriptions of the same work. Separate supply, installation, commissioning, and certification responsibilities instead of assuming one broad line covers all phases. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
